| :---: | :--- | :---: | :---: | :---: | :---: |
| **GET** | `@GetMapping` | **Yes** | **Yes** | `200 OK` | `404 Not Found` |
| **POST** | `@PostMapping` | **No** | **No** | `201 Created` | `400 Bad Request` / `409 Conflict` |
| **PUT** | `@PutMapping` | **Yes** | **No** | `200 OK` / `204 No Content` | `404 Not Found` / `400 Bad Request` |
